name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_3.png", "id": "1156543266444280", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1156543269777613_8460777624833310526_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vDudKWwVWu4Q7kNvwENJMCD&_nc_oc=AdoYNdARkLRX3Z9dkl418fLV1NaQ7IYA2TDYx4cuuuONwgqyVmqFdX7liFKv16-0BZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCzHhZM9Ux_SYkx__Gfej0StA6UzgzPtjXcpf2AEMZ8Fw&oe=6A6B6BF3"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_4.png", "id": "1894869561069837", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_1894869564403170_7211501422736374015_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0h53Fz6KrwYQ7kNvwF3rK3i&_nc_oc=Adro5UFX5AndAIa9A0c1ia_YYjj0N5eBtSuU5AOhF2TetW5lyGr-I5AIFfr6Ux3xdCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQANjozFsDsj0Bqqd1rRQdiiQA4aUfS48qWU_kW_EpjDBw&oe=6A6B425A"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_5.png", "id": "1562351141867401", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619450_1562351145200734_4496260998627128780_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3hmjuphnk7cQ7kNvwExOK5m&_nc_oc=Adr_Tt-fcyS2b6xynOP5_wEtbm37Q1-3qihMR9H5YRHesebZYuIpFZZQfDGNNDI3af8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDXwTltgv3V7VjKADV12pkD2sf3tq8zYEpuQ0uAftsdag&oe=6A6B63F2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "1344271310395789", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310896_1344271313729122_5607633694220372878_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EJLg0R_1jWsQ7kNvwHSKYj6&_nc_oc=AdrfReVVyl4r6W2YG6ADmnFbRbUSNcPd-ZdTMQbcpY8rFNhJeO30cUdHUIkFLkrj_14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDtnhB6EeX66USmgQf4lUUUEBD3cd5e5O4G6LZezgjGLw&oe=6A6B4D5C"}, "display_name": "Dodge - Face Barrage -", "keywords": [], "long_description": "[How to Play & Controls]\n1. On the title screen, tilt the analog stick left or right to change the difficulty level (choose from EASY, NORMAL, or HARD).\n2. Press the A or X button to start the game.\n3. Avoid obstacles (cubes) and aim for a high score.\n4. If your head hits a cube, your score will be displayed and you will be returned to the original title screen.\n5. On the title screen, press and hold the trigger button to exit the app.\n\n[How to operate Hand Tracking]\n\u30fbDIFFICULTY SELECT : Put Left Hand Forward\n\u30fbGAME START: Thumbs Up Right Hand (\ud83d\udc4d)\n\u30fbRESET BEST TIME: Raise Index Finger Your Right Hand (\u261c)\n\u30fbBGM[ON/OFF]: Raise Index Finger Your Left Hand (\u261e)\n\u30fbQUIT: Thumbs Up Left Hand (\ud83d\udc4d)\n\n[Game Tips & Specifications]\n- Only the head has hit detection, so obstacles hitting the limbs or torso will not count. Therefore, avoid only obstacles near your face.\n- The speed of the obstacles (cubes) is always constant and randomly generated.\n- The controller is not displayed in-game, so it is recommended that you keep it in your hand at all times or place it in an easily visible location.\n- The cube speed doubles as the difficulty level increases, but since dodging is extremely difficult on HARD, the number of cubes is set to a minimum.\n- Crouching and jumping are also effective methods of avoiding obstacles.\n\n[Summary]\nThe app is expected to improve reflexes and concentration to instantly avoid obstacles.", "short_description": "An app that trains your reflexes and concentration by avoiding obstacles approaching at high speeds"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "844306158286417", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dodge - \u9854\u9762\u5f3e\u5e55 -", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u3010\u904a\u3073\u65b9&\u64cd\u4f5c\u65b9\u6cd5\u3011\n\u2460\u30bf\u30a4\u30c8\u30eb\u753b\u9762\u3067\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u5de6\u53f3\u306b\u5012\u3057\u3066\u96e3\u6613\u5ea6\u3092\u5909\u66f4\u3059\u308b(EASY,NORMAL,HARD\u306e\uff13\u6bb5\u968e\u304b\u3089\u9078\u629e)\u3002\n\u2461A\u307e\u305fX\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u62bc\u3057\u3066\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u958b\u59cb\u3002\n\u2462\u969c\u5bb3\u7269(\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u30d6)\u3092\u3072\u305f\u3059\u3089\u907f\u3051\u3066\u30cf\u30a4\u30b9\u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u72d9\u3046\u3002\n\u2463\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u982d\u304c\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u30d6\u306b\u5f53\u305f\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3068\u3001\u30b9\u30b3\u30a2\u304c\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3068\u540c\u6642\u306b\u6700\u521d\u306e\u30bf\u30a4\u30c8\u30eb\u753b\u9762\u306b\u623b\u308b\u3002\n\u2464\u30bf\u30a4\u30c8\u30eb\u753b\u9762\u3067\u30c8\u30ea\u30ac\u30fc\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u9577\u62bc\u3057\u3059\u308b\u3068\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u7d42\u4e86\u3002\n\n\u3010\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u64cd\u4f5c\u65b9\u6cd5\u3011\n\u30fb\u96e3\u6613\u5ea6\u9078\u629e\uff1a\u5de6\u624b\u3092\u524d\u306b\u51fa\u3059\n\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8\uff1a\u53f3\u624b\u306e\u89aa\u6307\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u308b (\ud83d\udc4d)\n\u30fb\u30d9\u30b9\u30c8\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u30ea\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\uff1a\u53f3\u624b\u306e\u4eba\u5dee\u3057\u6307\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u308b (\u261c)\n\u30fbBGM[ON/OFF]\uff1a\u5de6\u624b\u306e\u4eba\u5dee\u3057\u6307\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u308b (\u261e)\n\u30fb\u7d42\u4e86\uff1a\u5de6\u624b\u306e\u89aa\u6307\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u308b (\ud83d\udc4d)\n\n\u3010\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u30b3\u30c4\uff06\u4ed5\u69d8\u8a73\u7d30\u3011\n\u30fb\u982d\u3060\u3051\u306b\u5f53\u305f\u308a\u5224\u5b9a\u304c\u3042\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u624b\u8db3\u3084\u80f4\u4f53\u306b\u969c\u5bb3\u7269\u304c\u5f53\u305f\u3063\u3066\u3082\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3055\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002\u3088\u3063\u3066\u9854\u4ed8\u8fd1\u306e\u969c\u5bb3\u7269\u306e\u307f\u56de\u907f\u3